Diagram:
  name: Music Scale and Chord Management
  version: 1.0
  version-ptd: 1.1
  description: PTD notation for managing music scales and chords, including scale filtering, chord playback, and MIDI interactions.
  files: change-scale.js, play-chord.js, globals.js, general-midi.js

Imports:
  change-scale.js (function changeScaleFilter, function setActiveScaleFilter, function setActiveScaleFilterToMatchChord)
    --> globals.js (object globals)
    --> jam-mapping-to-allowed.js (function buildNoteMap)
    --> findMatchingScales.js (function findTop3MatchingScales)
    --> note-tools.js (function createChordSymbol)
    --> chord-to-scale.js (function chordSymbolToScaleNames)
    --> scaleToNotes.js (function scaleObjToNotes, function chordNotesToScaleNotes)

  play-chord.js (function playChord, function playChordNote, function playChordOff)
    --> globals.js (object globals)
    --> change-scale.js (function changeScaleFilter)
    --> general-midi.js (function playGmNote, function stopGmNote)

Files:
  file: change-scale.js
    Variables:
      const options: object
    Functions:
      changeScaleFilter(scaleFilter): void
      setActiveScaleFilter(scaleTonic, scaleType, scaleNotes, scaleTypes, override): void
      setActiveScaleFilterToMatchChord(chordTonic, chordType, strategy): void
      _setActiveScaleFilter(scaleNotes): void
      clearActiveScaleFilter(): void
      calcScaleTypesDropdown(chordConfig): string[]
      calcScaleTypesDropdownFromChordSymbol(chordSymbol, strategy): string[]
      reportScaleChange(msg): void

  file: play-chord.js
    Variables:
      const noteOffInfo: object
    Functions:
      playChord(singleNote, options): void
      changeChordTriggerNoteAndThusScale(singleNote): void
      playChordNote(noteName, toneType, options, channel, triggerNote, pendingNoteOffs): void
      playChordOff(singleNote): void

Classes:
  N/A (No explicit classes defined in these files)

Use Cases:
  Sequence: Change Scale Filter
    🧍‍♂️ -> changeScaleFilter(scaleFilter) [change-scale.js]
         checks globals.scaleFiltering.frozen
         -> globals.currentChordTriggerNote [globals.js]
             validates chord trigger note
         -> globals.currentChordConfig() [globals.js]
             retrieves current chord configuration
         -> _setActiveScaleFilter(scaleNotes) [change-scale.js]
             builds scale trigger map
             -> buildNoteMap(scaleNotes, ...) [jam-mapping-to-allowed.js]
                 creates note mapping
             < void
         -> reportScaleChange(scaleFilter) [change-scale.js]
             broadcasts scale change events
             -> document.broadcastEvent('scale-changed') [Document]
             -> document.broadcastEvent('scale-filtering-changed') [Document]
         < void

  Sequence: Play Chord
    🧍‍♂️ -> playChord(singleNote, options) [play-chord.js]
         validates singleNote in globals.chordTriggerMap
         -> changeChordTriggerNoteAndThusScale(singleNote) [play-chord.js]
             updates globals.currentChordTriggerNote
             -> changeScaleFilter('rhnotes') [change-scale.js]
                 resets scale filter
         -> document.broadcastEvent('chord-changed') [Document]
             updates UI for chord changes
         -> playChordNote(noteName, 'bass', options, ...) [play-chord.js]
             plays bass note
             -> playGmNote(noteName, ...) [general-midi.js]
                 sends MIDI note-on
         -> playChordNote(noteName, 'chord', options, ...) [play-chord.js]
             plays chord notes
             -> playGmNote(noteName, ...) [general-midi.js]
                 sends MIDI note-on
         < void

  Sequence: Stop Chord
    🧍‍♂️ -> playChordOff(singleNote) [play-chord.js]
         validates singleNote in globals.chordTriggerMap
         -> stopGmNote(noteOffInfo) [general-midi.js]
             stops MIDI note
         < void